{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34152","headline":"奉和袭美公斋四咏次韵 小桂 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美公斋四咏次韵 小桂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"讽赋轻八植，擅名方一枝。\n才高不满意，更自寒山移。\n宛宛别云态，苍苍出尘姿。\n烟归助华杪，雪点迎芳蕤。\n青条坐可结，白日如奔螭。\n谅无𠠜翦忧，即是萧森时\n洛浦虽有荫，骚人聊自怡。\n终爲济川檝，岂在论高卑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}